1	/**
2	 * SFCC-270 (plan step 2.2). Covers:
3	 *   - item-image.tsx: a caller-supplied `width`/`mr` must win over the Zimmermann default
4	 *     (item-variant.css.ts's `image` part) — this is exactly what order-summary/index.jsx's
5	 *     (base, not-yet-overridden) `<CartItemVariantImage width="80px" mr={2} />` depends on.
6	 *   - item-name.tsx: a caller-supplied `color` must win over the Zimmermann default — the bug
7	 *     fix at this step (base had the spread BEFORE the explicit `color`, silently discarding
8	 *     any caller value).
