23	 * .claude/rules/testing.md): `useCurrency` (full replacement — this file's render tree never
24	 * needs the real `useDerivedProduct` also exported from that barrel, unlike
25	 * product-item/index.test.tsx, so no `vi.importActual` juggling is needed here), a real-network
26	 * `useCurrentBasket`, `PromoPopover` (imports the base icons barrel, throws under Vitest per
27	 * testing.md's documented ZimmIcon gap), and `usePromotions`/`useProducts`/`useProduct` from
28	 * `@salesforce/commerce-sdk-react`. `useBreakpointValue` is mocked directly (from `@chakra-ui/react`,
29	 * which `shared/ui`'s own `useBreakpointValue` module just re-exports) so item-price.tsx's
30	 * `isDesktop` resolves to an exact, per-test value — the same pattern
31	 * zimmSizeSelector/index.test.tsx already establishes, rather than fighting Chakra's internal
32	 * breakpoint-matching media queries via a `window.matchMedia` mock.
33	 */
34	import React from 'react';
